# Scaffolding, not concepts. Every pattern below is exercised by a file that
# would FAIL conformance if it were read as a concept.

# A bare name matches the BASENAME at any depth.
README.md

# A trailing slash makes it a directory. With no other `/` it matches at any
# depth, so this catches a/_scratch/ as well as _scratch/.
_scratch/

# With a `/` it is anchored at the bundle root -- other/vendor/ is untouched.
pkg/vendor/

# `*` stops at a `/`.
*.draft.md

# `/**/` spans any number of directories, INCLUDING none.
notes/**/tmp.md

# The last matching line decides, so `!` re-includes.
!pkg/vendor/keep.md

# Reserved filenames (SPEC 3.1) are never ignorable: a bundle that could hide
# its own index would lose its okf_version. This line does nothing.
log.md
